From 3860a350df456e072e3b43052c078d5a6a4be751 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PocketForge Maintainers <maintainers@pocketforge.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/50] tests: drive A133 native DE2 scanout through IOMMU

Replace the virtio-gpu proxy path in the display export test with the
release driver's native contract: populate sun50i IOMMU tables, program
DE2 UI channel 2, and commit via the mixer double-buffer register. Require
finite DSI and TCON command completion rather than write-discard stubs.

Rebase resolutions:
- Qobject: use the v11 qobject/ QDict header after replacing the earlier virtio display fixture.

Assisted-by: LLM

